# Exercise-agnostic rep counter

This repo detects reps from **motion patterns** (angle variance or vertical Y displacement), not named exercises.

## Never add

- Exercise-named joints or fields (`SHRUG`, `CURL`, `shrug_y_signal`, etc.)
- Per-joint TOML sections (`[rep.joints.*]`, `[angle_selection.joints.*]`)
- Hardcoded joint lists for behavior (use `modality`, `eligibility`, or `scale.kind`)

## Always use

- **Modality-based config**: `[rep.vertical_px]`, `[angle_selection.vertical_px]` vs global `[rep]` / `[angle_selection]`
- **Anatomical signal keys** in `COMMON_ANGLES` (e.g. `SHOULDER_Y`, `LEFT_ELBOW`), not exercise names
- **Generic fixes** to selection, handoff, margins, and fallback — not one-limb special cases

See `AGENTS.md` for full guidelines.
